    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The bluetoothreceiver connects to a device and feeds the QgsNmeaConnection over QBluetoothSocket. It receives QgsGpsInformation and converts it to <ref refid="classQfGnssPositionInformation" kindref="compound">QfGnssPositionInformation</ref> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
